id: DRAFT-libsz-1.1.6-ctest-short-summary-lasttest-crosscheck
trigger_tool: ctest|conan
phase: testing
error_signature: HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT=\{[^}]*exit 0 but no ctest summary line[^}]*|ctest file evidence:.*LastTest\.log bytes=
severity: 3
category: testing, build-system, cmake, ohos, compat
match_keywords: ctest_short_format, 100% tests passed out of, no ctest summary line, LastTest.log, HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT
title: 兼容精简版ctest短格式汇总行的容错解析与LastTest.log交叉验证
root_cause: 真机shim-ctest输出短格式100% tests passed out of 7无0 tests failed中段且stdout仅876字节详情只落盘1.8MB LastTest.log，前两轮强制要求失败计数中段的摘要正则永不匹配致exit 0误判无摘要
 (!10653)
affected_scope: shim或精简版ctest输出短格式汇总、stdout被精简详情只落盘Testing/Temporary/LastTest.log且discovered N executed 0的ctest harness误判场景
verification_cmd: 真机preflight日志应显示HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT status passed且ctest summary-line长短格式兼容解析并附LastTest.log交叉证据
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: tolerant-short-summary-plus-lasttest-crosscheck
rec_description: 两处摘要正则失败计数改为可选组短格式以percent==100判零失败，字节捕获errors=replace剥ANSI回车空白容忍匹配，跑前清陈旧LastTest*.log并以LastTest.log逐用例Passed加LastTestsFailed为空加Total Test time大于0四重交叉验证，上游测试零改动
rec_command: conanfile.py: 摘要正则失败组可选化+percent==100判零失败+LastTest.log交叉复核；跑前删除Testing/Temporary/LastTest*.log；test_package与上游tests零改动
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-only
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: structured-diagnosis-fail-closed
fallback_description: 若摘要与落盘证据仍对不齐则输出ctest路径目录rc字节数摘要行verdict尾部日志的结构化诊断并保持fail-closed，不伪造通过待下轮全量stdout排查
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT=\{[^}]*"status":"passed"[^}]*"executed":0
forbid_1_reason: 禁止在executed为0或缺逐用例Passed时仅凭短格式百分比伪造通过，须逐用例Passed齐备且与LastTest.log交叉验证
forbid_1_consequence: 真机预检evidence incomplete或误判放行，任务退回修复循环
similar_to: []
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-libsz-1.1.6-ctest-short-summary-lasttest-crosscheck.md
last_updated: 2026-09-17
source_event: libsz/1.1.6真机预检upstream_test失败exit 0无摘要行经短格式容错与落盘交叉验证修复并通过全部门禁
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 10653
